00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:39.360
and later when I saved up and moved to LA, but&nbsp;
eventually those resources run out and you have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:45.200
to pay rent. There's a definite class element to&nbsp;
